    <section class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_0.72fr] lg:items-end">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--color-primary)]">ZIP · TGZ · TAR.GZ · local-first</p>
        <h1 class="display-font mt-4 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-6xl">Private archives, carefully shared.</h1>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--color-muted)]">Open compressed archives in your browser, find files by name or type, and prepare an LLM-ready summary. Private files stay in this browser. Choose a file profile and explicitly publish only the items you select.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="rounded-[var(--radius)] border border-[var(--color-primary)] bg-[var(--color-overlay)] p-5 sm:p-6">
        <h2 class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-primary)]">Private means local to this browser</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--color-muted)]">Archives are saved in this browser’s IndexedDB, not uploaded. Shared packages contain the files you choose and are readable by anyone who receives the package or link. Avoid secrets and personal data. Browser storage is not a backup—download anything important.</p>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-8 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-[0.72fr_1.28fr]">
      <article class="h-fit rounded-[var(--radius)] border border-[var(--color-line)] bg-[var(--color-surface)] p-5 sm:p-6">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[var(--color-primary)]">1 · Add a private archive</p>
        <h2 class="display-font mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold">Upload ZIP or tar.gz</h2>
        <label id="drop-zone" for="archive-input" class="drop-zone mt-5 grid min-h-44 cursor-pointer place-items-center rounded-[var(--radius)] p-6 text-center transition">
          <span>
            <span class="mx-auto grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-[var(--radius)] bg-[var(--color-overlay-soft)] text-2xl text-[var(--color-primary)]" aria-hidden="true">＋</span>
            <span class="mt-3 block font-semibold">Choose an archive or drop it here</span>
            <span class="mt-1 block text-xs leading-5 text-[var(--color-muted)]">.zip · .tgz · .tar.gz</span>
          </span>
        </label>
        <input id="archive-input" type="file" accept=".zip,.tgz,.tar.gz,application/zip,application/gzip" class="sr-only">
        <p id="upload-status" class="mt-4 text-sm text-[var(--color-muted)]" role="status" aria-live="polite">Archive contents are extracted locally in your browser.</p>
