          <p class="mt-2 max-w-4xl text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--color-muted)]">Uploading creates a private, browser-local archive. Type profiles help select matching file names; you can refine that selection manually. Preparing a public package copies only checked files, and the checkbox confirmation is required. Small packages can be shared in a URL; larger packages should be shared using the downloaded JSON file. Anyone with either copy can read its contents.</p>
        </div>
        <button id="delete-active-archive" type="button" class="focus-ring rounded-[var(--radius)] border border-[var(--color-line-strong)] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold">Delete active private archive</button>
